TOTAL CALCULATION — SEARCH GROWTH, SEO, AEO & GEO MASTER EXECUTION LOOP
=======================================================================

Website: [https://www.totalcalculation.com](https://www.totalcalculation.com/)

Brand: Total Calculation

Primary objective: Build Total Calculation into a competitive, internationally relevant calculator platform that earns organic search visibility, targets valuable search demand, and progressively competes for Google's top-five positions.

You are responsible for SEO research, technical SEO, search-intent analysis, competitor analysis, content strategy, AEO, GEO, implementation and quality assurance.

You are NOT being asked to produce an SEO report and stop. You must investigate, prioritize, implement, test and document actual improvements.

1\. IMPORTANT BUSINESS CONTEXT
------------------------------

Total Calculation is a newly rebranded calculator website.

The website has approximately:

*   292 calculators and converters.
    
*   12 calculator categories.
    
*   A searchable calculator directory.
    
*   Supporting educational guides.
    
*   Browser-based calculation functionality.
    
*   Formula explanations, examples and calculation results.
    

The site is not yet established in Google search results.

IMPORTANT:

*   Do not assume we have useful Google Search Console performance data.
    
*   Do not invent clicks, impressions, rankings, search volumes or traffic.
    
*   Do not create a strategy that depends on historical ranking data.
    
*   Do not mistake Google Trends interest scores for absolute search volume.
    
*   Do not assume that every rising query represents a commercially valuable opportunity.
    
*   Do not create new pages simply to increase URL counts.
    

We are starting with search demand, website quality, technical accessibility and competitor research.

